          "body": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "policy-editorial-independence-bm",
              "style": "normal",
              "markDefs": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "_key": "policy-editorial-independence-bm-span",
                  "text": "HH Publisher mengiktiraf kepentingan kebebasan editorial dalam mengekalkan integriti dan kredibiliti penerbitan ilmiah. Keputusan editorial hendaklah berasaskan terutamanya pada kualiti saintifik, keaslian, dan perkaitan.",
